                "rules_key": "groups.epf.wage_ceiling",
                "note": "Read this before quoting the figure. \"The wage ceiling for coverage under the EPF Scheme, 1952 is revised from time to time. Presently, it is Rs.15000/- per month since 01.09.2014.\" Section 6 of the Act carries no ceiling at all -- it lives in the Employees' Provident Fund Scheme, 1952, whose consolidated text could not be retrieved, and the 2014 notification that set it could not be retrieved either. This is the Government's statement of the figure, not the instrument that fixed it."
              }
